    "text": "Land Ministry Number.: 4/3/9/2015/IR/220C. IT is hereby notified under Section 7 (1) of the Land Acquisition Act that the Government intends to acquire the following lands required for the construction of the canal line from the Malipoththa tank :- Description of the land to be acquired : Allotments of land in F.T.P. 19 supplement 2 Sheet No. 16 prepared by the superintendent of Surveyor in Monaragala, situated in Bibile Village in Bibile Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of the District of Monaragala in Uva Province described as follows. Total Extent of the Hectares : 1.0909 01. Lot No. 296 Name of the Land: Buruthakatiya; Claimant: Government; Prior Owner: R.M. Sriyalatha; Extent : 0.1084 Hectare.",
